### 1) Seed sample FAQ articles + index them
POST http://localhost:8094/api/demo/seed
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 2) Semantic search (offline: deterministic local embeddings + Lucene)
GET http://localhost:8094/api/faq/search?q=cancel%20subscription&limit=5

### 3) Ask (defaults to SEARCH_ONLY unless generation is enabled + provider configured)
POST http://localhost:8094/api/faq/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "How can I cancel my subscription and will I get a refund?",
  "limit": 5
}

### 4) Reindex everything (useful after manual edits)
POST http://localhost:8094/api/demo/indexing/reindex/articles
Content-Type: application/json

{}
